120	    /**
121	     * Fixed region-to-postcode range table: each region admits an inclusive 4-digit range
122	     * ({@code NSW 2000-2099}, {@code VIC 3000-3099}, {@code QLD 4000-4099}). Used to derive an
123	     * owner's locality from its postcode in preference to its city.
